From: patch-author <a@a.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 02:11:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 0370: Steamworks SDK wired in for real -- achievements
 side

(Rebuilt against the real current HEAD -- this was first handed over as
'0364' against a now-stale local clone; patches 0364-0369 landed from
unrelated work in the meantime. Same content, renumbered, re-verified.)

- steamworks.js@0.4.0 installed; electron/main.ts inits it against App ID
  5143490, gated by app.isPackaged for restartAppIfNecessary, wrapped in
  try/catch so no-Steam-running is a graceful no-op, not a crash.
- steam:unlockAchievement's patch-0009 stub swapped for the real
  client.achievement.activate() call -- renderer side untouched.
- vite.config.ts: steamworks.js marked external for the main-process
  Rollup bundle (native .node require otherwise fails to parse).
- New steam_appid.txt at repo root for local dev/testing outside Steam.
- Verified for real: npx tsc --noEmit, npx vite build, a full
  electron-builder --linux dir package build (confirmed native binary
  placement in app.asar.unpacked), and a launch of that packaged binary
  confirming the no-Steam fallback path.
